# Two Runeswords on two of Bot2's attackers in one turn: each one's effects are about its own creature, from the time its
# own ability resolved (CR 611.2c). Runesword A resolves on Ornithopter; Bot2's Triskelion then pings Bot2's Grizzly Bears;
# Runesword B resolves on the Triskelion, which pings Llanowar Elves to death - exiled instead (B's effect). The Bears,
# dealt damage by the Triskelion only before B's ability resolved, die to Shock later that turn and go to the graveyard.
